  <title>Ondersteunde bestandsformaten</title>

  <p>File formats that are supported by <app>File Roller</app> include:</p>

  <list type="numbered">
    <item><p>Enkel archief</p>
      <list>
        <item><p>AIX klein geïndexeerd archief (<file>.ar</file>)</p></item>
        <item><p>ISO-9660-cd-schijfbestand [alleen-lezen-modus] (<file>.iso</file>)</p></item>
        <item><p>Tape-archiefbestand (<file>.tar</file>)</p></item>
      </list>
    </item>
    <item><p>Archief en compressie</p>
      <list>
        <item><p>Java-arcihef (<file>.jar</file>)</p></item>
        <item><p>WinRAR-gecomprimeerd archief (<file>.rar</file>)</p></item>
        <item><p>Tape-archiefbestand gecomprimeerd met:</p>
          <list>
            <item><p>gzip (<file>.tar.gz</file>, <file>.tgz</file>)</p></item>
            <item><p>bzip (<file>.tar.bz</file>, <file>.tbz</file>)</p></item>
            <item><p>bzip2 (<file>.tar.bz2</file>, <file>.tbz2</file>)</p></item>
            <item><p>lzop (<file>.tar.lzo</file>, <file>.tzo</file>)</p></item>
            <item><p>7zip (<file>.tar.7z</file>)</p></item>
            <item><p>xz (<file>.tar.xz</file>)</p></item>
          </list>
        </item>
        <item><p>Cabinet-bestand (<file>.cab</file>)</p></item>
        <item><p>ZIP-gearchiveerd stripverhaal (<file>.cbz</file>)</p></item>
        <item><p>ZIP-archief (<file>.zip</file>)</p></item>
        <item><p>ZOO-gecomprimeerd archiefbestand (<file>.zoo</file>)</p></item>
      </list>
    </item>
  </list>

<!-- TODO: how does one install the plugins? -->
  <note>
    <p>For some file formats, <app>File Roller</app> may require additional
    plugins.</p>
  </note>

